            <ArticleTitle>Management of post-operative pain: current concepts and methods of management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper discusses the aetiology, incidence and severity of post-operative pain including factors that influence post-operative pain. Current concepts and the need for effective control of post-operative pain are discussed. A review of the various methods available for post-operative pain management is presented with special reference to practice in a developing country.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
